{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/fd003afca6e47c6f5326066dd1e61a6d.avif?t=1772800792\" width=600 height=135 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your transport empire on land, water and in the air! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/b838e3b6023708a6b20f205e05953318.webp?t=1772800792\" width=500 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build trucks, buses, ships, planes, trains, trams, maglevs, helicopter and zeppelins to transport goods and passengers between industry buildings and cities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Renew your transport vehicles and replace them with better versions. Manufactories will offer you exclusive and special vehicle variants which will give you benefits. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/185804955db174aac179fc0c91af3b29.poster.avif?t=1772800792\" width=500 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/185804955db174aac179fc0c91af3b29.webm?t=1772800792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/185804955db174aac179fc0c91af3b29.mp4?t=1772800792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/e8010301b82b55e18a0af66eb7a750b2.webp?t=1772800792\" width=500 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can research vehicle improvements to increase the efficiency of your vehicles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/8e51d9bc2839b55a49e7a104eff672dc.avif?t=1772800792\" width=500 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/17373c97450f1d5eb35a73101e32dd3d.webp?t=1772800792\" width=500 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work your way up and reach the rank Tycoon. Unlock new gameplay features with each rank, finally become mayor of a city and apply for political offices. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/7efece9ec01ecfb550ae42e5b4069845.webp?t=1772800792\" width=500 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you become the mayor of a city, you can build a prestige project and win the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/129efc27a0be375e322d4a3944c809d6.avif?t=1772800792\" width=500 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/0439b69b34a38eccb69b00a9369b6043.webp?t=1772800792\" width=500 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a company headquarters foundation and gradually expand your company headquarters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/693e0aa4fd0751dd62d3fcdd9764892f.avif?t=1772800792\" width=500 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/09cc5919c6b47ff9410f8c49fe304973.webp?t=1772800792\" width=500 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with up to 20 computer opponents on huge procedurally generated maps. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sabotage your opponents or make agreements to prevent sabotage acts against your transport routes. Cooperate with them to provide cities as quickly as possible or buy unpleasant competitors. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/26b6cd52e66552420ea6c65538a4edd8.poster.avif?t=1772800792\" width=500 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/26b6cd52e66552420ea6c65538a4edd8.webm?t=1772800792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/26b6cd52e66552420ea6c65538a4edd8.mp4?t=1772800792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/81f47cb7d58b677ea5321bb14a319f33.webp?t=1772800792\" width=500 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage the power supply for cities and industries by delivering the required goods to power plants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/d20af0a3ae5f85211846643e703ab46b.avif?t=1772800792\" width=500 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/dbfced5189f77ff95eb112c16ed8f0bc.webp?t=1772800792\" width=500 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help cities grow by satisfying their needs for goods, food and luxury goods. Big cities provide more passengers which can be transported to nearby cities profitably. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/462486ccf675170d057284d655c238a9.poster.avif?t=1772800792\" width=500 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/462486ccf675170d057284d655c238a9.webm?t=1772800792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/462486ccf675170d057284d655c238a9.mp4?t=1772800792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/09f554b10e11b442506316363dd8eefd.webp?t=1772800792\" width=500 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transport 40 different goods between 39 different industries and numerous cities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your station stock low to get a production bonus from industry buildings. Deliver machinery and tools to industry buildings to get a production boost for a short period of time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/043b390b50a8134c8fd50a1411505034.poster.avif?t=1772800792\" width=500 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/043b390b50a8134c8fd50a1411505034.webm?t=1772800792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/043b390b50a8134c8fd50a1411505034.mp4?t=1772800792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"929e4c77609448efd0fbcb8973a659ebba1c3784.jpg","localized_name":"Head of department","name":"Head of department","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/659920/929e4c77609448efd0fbcb8973a659ebba1c3784.jpg"},{"icon":"54f18e3e116782b49f28f068939904d6ab2ae0ac.jpg","localized_name":"District Manager","name":"District Manager","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/659920/54f18e3e116782b49f28f068939904d6ab2ae0ac.jpg"},{"icon":"9cbdcfc258aeb2aafb7f3057ef015e9e4b4cc296.jpg","localized_name":"Managing Director","name":"Managing Director","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/659920/9cbdcfc258aeb2aafb7f3057ef015e9e4b4cc296.jpg"},{"icon":"9e3187e856e49ead8e21f0ce20c6772854422b67.jpg","localized_name":"Tycoon","name":"Tycoon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/659920/9e3187e856e49ead8e21f0ce20c6772854422b67.jpg"},{"icon":"aef199071839cabe7a0e92e54464bef06dc7636c.jpg","localized_name":"Mayor","name":"Mayor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/659920/aef199071839cabe7a0e92e54464bef06dc7636c.jpg"},{"icon":"ed7b54d4a6870014e4a43fde809106fbcd66e96f.jpg","localized_name":"Technology level","name":"Technology level","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/659920/ed7b54d4a6870014e4a43fde809106fbcd66e96f.jpg"},{"icon":"5e5be850cd0801d964feb037c9c6a95ebed5aaf6.jpg","localized_name":"Minister of Finance","name":"Minister of Finance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/659920/5e5be850cd0801d964feb037c9c6a95ebed5aaf6.jpg"},{"icon":"5b4c1cb87da491d05f8509cabebf1f813bfd3162.jpg","localized_name":"Research","name":"Research","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/659920/5b4c1cb87da491d05f8509cabebf1f813bfd3162.jpg"},{"icon":"dbf3ed0f6d2cffe98888c98954e9b0071af4c033.jpg","localized_name":"Minister of Construction","name":"Minister of Construction","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/659920/dbf3ed0f6d2cffe98888c98954e9b0071af4c033.jpg"},{"icon":"b7843af32f329a5530c5e309459373c57e749795.jpg","localized_name":"Minister of Security","name":"Minister of Security","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/659920/b7843af32f329a5530c5e309459373c57e749795.jpg"}],"total":21},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/659920?t=1772800792","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/6e24abdbec980704df1d0f2204912e7125d60d39/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772800792","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/8b658f06ac531fc38c145f9035ae87242099cca9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772800792","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/8b658f06ac531fc38c145f9035ae87242099cca9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772800792","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3585140,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>STEAM WORKSHOP SUPPORT</h1><p>Update 1.13 adds Steam Workshop support to Transports. Create mods for Transports and share your creations with your friends and other players.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/fd003afca6e47c6f5326066dd1e61a6d.avif?t=1772800792\" width=600 height=135 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your transport empire on land, water and in the air! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/b838e3b6023708a6b20f205e05953318.webp?t=1772800792\" width=500 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build trucks, buses, ships, planes, trains, trams, maglevs, helicopter and zeppelins to transport goods and passengers between industry buildings and cities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Renew your transport vehicles and replace them with better versions. Manufactories will offer you exclusive and special vehicle variants which will give you benefits. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/185804955db174aac179fc0c91af3b29.poster.avif?t=1772800792\" width=500 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/185804955db174aac179fc0c91af3b29.webm?t=1772800792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/185804955db174aac179fc0c91af3b29.mp4?t=1772800792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/e8010301b82b55e18a0af66eb7a750b2.webp?t=1772800792\" width=500 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can research vehicle improvements to increase the efficiency of your vehicles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/8e51d9bc2839b55a49e7a104eff672dc.avif?t=1772800792\" width=500 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/17373c97450f1d5eb35a73101e32dd3d.webp?t=1772800792\" width=500 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work your way up and reach the rank Tycoon. Unlock new gameplay features with each rank, finally become mayor of a city and apply for political offices. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/7efece9ec01ecfb550ae42e5b4069845.webp?t=1772800792\" width=500 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you become the mayor of a city, you can build a prestige project and win the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/129efc27a0be375e322d4a3944c809d6.avif?t=1772800792\" width=500 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/0439b69b34a38eccb69b00a9369b6043.webp?t=1772800792\" width=500 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a company headquarters foundation and gradually expand your company headquarters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/693e0aa4fd0751dd62d3fcdd9764892f.avif?t=1772800792\" width=500 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/09cc5919c6b47ff9410f8c49fe304973.webp?t=1772800792\" width=500 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with up to 20 computer opponents on huge procedurally generated maps. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sabotage your opponents or make agreements to prevent sabotage acts against your transport routes. Cooperate with them to provide cities as quickly as possible or buy unpleasant competitors. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/26b6cd52e66552420ea6c65538a4edd8.poster.avif?t=1772800792\" width=500 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/26b6cd52e66552420ea6c65538a4edd8.webm?t=1772800792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/26b6cd52e66552420ea6c65538a4edd8.mp4?t=1772800792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/81f47cb7d58b677ea5321bb14a319f33.webp?t=1772800792\" width=500 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage the power supply for cities and industries by delivering the required goods to power plants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/d20af0a3ae5f85211846643e703ab46b.avif?t=1772800792\" width=500 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/dbfced5189f77ff95eb112c16ed8f0bc.webp?t=1772800792\" width=500 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help cities grow by satisfying their needs for goods, food and luxury goods. Big cities provide more passengers which can be transported to nearby cities profitably. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/462486ccf675170d057284d655c238a9.poster.avif?t=1772800792\" width=500 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/462486ccf675170d057284d655c238a9.webm?t=1772800792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/462486ccf675170d057284d655c238a9.mp4?t=1772800792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/09f554b10e11b442506316363dd8eefd.webp?t=1772800792\" width=500 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transport 40 different goods between 39 different industries and numerous cities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your station stock low to get a production bonus from industry buildings. Deliver machinery and tools to industry buildings to get a production boost for a short period of time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/043b390b50a8134c8fd50a1411505034.poster.avif?t=1772800792\" width=500 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/043